WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A missing detail can hide in plain sight. Your attention does not record everything.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
That is a lesson about perception, not proof that any sound can change your mind.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Zen12's seller describes twelve levels, forty-eight recordings and four listening styles.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try an ordinary twelve-minute pause first. Keep notes. Compare the cost and the claims.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Our independent guide keeps the evidence separate from the advertising. Decide for yourself.
